# The Goblin Tailor (jeuno 42): the offer's operands and the level check while accepted (two chars: the level is a char
# line's). Main at level 9, fame level 3: 10020; bob at level 10, fame level 2 ((249 + 0 + 0) / 2 = 124): 10020; bob's
# fame 250 (a GM): 10016 (1, 1), begun. Main accepted (a GM) at level 9: 10020; [RSE]Gear 15 (a GM) at level 9: 10019
# (the gear check first).
lists LowerJeuno/Guttrix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10016
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-34.5,5.5,-139.7 job=WAR lvl=9
char bob zone=LowerJeuno pos=-34.5,5.5,-138.2 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Sandoria 250
bob: fame Sandoria 249
login
trigger Guttrix                         # level 9: 10020
finish
bob: login
bob: trigger Guttrix                    # level 10, fame level 2: 10020
bob: finish
bob: fame Sandoria 250                  # a GM: fame level 3
bob: trigger Guttrix                    # level 10, fame level 3: 10016 (1, 1)
bob: finish                             # begun
quest Jeuno.TheGoblinTailor available   # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGoblinTailor accepted    # a GM
trigger Guttrix                         # accepted, level 9: 10020
finish
charvar [RSE]Gear 15                    # a GM
trigger Guttrix                         # [RSE]Gear 15 first: 10019
finish
